{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act51side_level_act51side_04_end","storyGroup":"act51side","storySort":9,"storyDependence":"act51side_level_act51side_04_beg","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"PA-4","storyName":"一墙之隔","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"娜塔莉娅四处奔走，在一些人的帮助下，找到了支持巴普洛维奇的关键人物——特里波列夫公爵。她设法威胁了公爵，使他不得不停止对巴普洛维奇的援助。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act51side/level_act51side_04_end","avgTag":"行动后","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act51side_04","minState":"PASS","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":7,"next":9,"characters":["苦艾","急切的贵族","仲裁人","早露","某位议员","某位公爵","？？？","特里波列夫公爵","沃伦佐娃夫人"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":4},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/93/Avg_bg_66_g12_deitygrypherburgmeeting.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":5},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":6},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":7},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$darkness02_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_dia_darkness02_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":8,"musicid":0},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_405_absin_1#1$2","duration":"1","id":9},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":10},{"type":"dialogue","name":"苦艾","text":"“......之后，我对照名单，依次与各个学生见面。”","id":11,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_avg_405_absin_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"苦艾","text":"“与索尼娅不同，他们被送到城墙边的办公室与我交谈，大多面带恐惧，什么都不敢说。”","id":12,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_avg_405_absin_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_177","id":13},{"type":"dialogue","name":"急切的贵族","text":"我受够了！仲裁人阁下，帝国的听证会怎能纵容如此荒谬的、针对一位清白贵族的侮辱？","id":14,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_npc_177.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"急切的贵族","text":"他曾是陛下亲封的枢密官，如果事实真如娜塔莉娅描述的那样，他又怎么可能取得这样的殊荣？","id":15,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_npc_177.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"急切的贵族","text":"任谁都能听出来，这封信名为忏悔，实为诘难，我们不能再被谣言牵着走了。","id":16,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_npc_177.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"急切的贵族","text":"据我所知，现场还有一份——","id":17,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_npc_177.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_405_absin_1#6$2","id":18},{"type":"dialogue","name":"苦艾","text":"这位大人，无论您对巴普洛维奇大人的“管理艺术”抱有怎样的欣赏态度，都请不要因此就把娜塔莉娅亲笔写下的血泪称为谣言。","id":19,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a8/Avg_avg_405_absin_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"苦艾","text":"您不能因为我们此刻都在温暖的厅堂中对话，就否认外面正有人因饥寒交迫而战栗。","id":20,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a8/Avg_avg_405_absin_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_405_absin_1#7$2","id":21},{"type":"dialogue","name":"苦艾","text":"毕竟，依照您的想法，如果世上真有那么多苦难，乌萨斯怎么可能繁荣数百年呢？","id":22,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f7/Avg_avg_405_absin_1-7$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_177","id":23},{"type":"dialogue","name":"急切的贵族","text":"卓娅女士，注意你的措辞。听证会尊重你烈士子女的身份，出于信任和对公正的索求让你来辅助作证，不是让你来这里侮辱贵族的！","id":24,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_npc_177.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_405_absin_1#6$2","id":25},{"type":"dialogue","name":"苦艾","text":"仲裁委员会明鉴，我分明是在维护一位真正的贵族，我决不容忍任何人轻率地用“谣言”去污蔑她。","id":26,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a8/Avg_avg_405_absin_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_177","id":27},{"type":"dialogue","name":"急切的贵族","text":"荒谬——","id":28,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_npc_177.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2168_1#1$1","id":29},{"type":"dialogue","name":"仲裁人","text":"安静！","id":30,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d0/Avg_avg_npc_2168_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"仲裁人","text":"卓娅女士，你的责任是代为陈述娜塔莉娅小姐的证词，事实判断是仲裁委员会才能做的。","id":31,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d0/Avg_avg_npc_2168_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_405_absin_1#1$2","id":32},{"type":"dialogue","name":"苦艾","text":"......抱歉，仲裁人阁下。","id":33,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_avg_405_absin_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"苦艾","text":"如果诸位大人在意的是“忏悔”的部分，那么接下来就是了。","id":34,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_avg_405_absin_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"苦艾","text":"还请仲裁人阁下允许我继续。","id":35,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_avg_405_absin_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2168_1#1$1","id":36},{"type":"dialogue","name":"仲裁人","text":"记住，如果你继续试图对任何贵族的观点进行评判，那么我将不再允许你发言。","id":37,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d0/Avg_avg_npc_2168_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"仲裁人","text":"继续吧。","id":38,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d0/Avg_avg_npc_2168_1$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":39},{"type":"dialog","id":40},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":41},{"type":"charslot","id":42},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":43},{"type":"subtitle","text":"<i>“当我回到城中，向他们的父母汇报情况时，有的家长会多留我一会儿，想要了解更多有关他们孩子的情况。”</i>","x":"300","y":"330","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"720","id":44},{"type":"subtitle","text":"<i>“为了寻找缓解封锁区内境况的契机，我必须要试探谁能够提供更多的帮助。”</i>","x":"300","y":"330","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"720","id":45},{"type":"subtitle","text":"<i>“于是，我挑选了几位家长私下见面，刻意渲染了学生们所处境况的窘迫与凄惨。”</i>","x":"300","y":"330","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"720","id":46},{"type":"subtitle","text":"<i>“最终，我找到了一位独生子被押的贵族，而他迫不及待地将我引荐给了他的上司。”</i>","x":"300","y":"330","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"720","id":47},{"type":"subtitle","id":48},{"type":"dialog","id":49},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":50},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_197_poca_1#4$1","id":51},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/47/Avg_bg_72_g13_nobleroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":52},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":53},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":54},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$ponder_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act15d0d0/m_avg_ponder_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":55,"musicid":1},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"......以上就是我在封锁区内的全部见闻，议员阁下。","id":56,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_197_poca_1#5$1","id":57},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"若是继续坐视巴普洛维奇大人的行为，甚至继续放任他们使用大型武器，这一定会在不久后酿成无法挽回的惨剧。","id":58,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":59},{"type":"charslot","id":60},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2162_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":61},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":62},{"type":"dialogue","name":"某位议员","text":"娜塔莉娅小姐，从你的表述来看，你似乎希望议会能公布巴普洛维奇的罪行，从而剥夺他的官秩，甚至将其撤职。","id":63,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_2162_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_197_poca_1#12$1","id":64},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"我只是希望能阻止他。","id":65,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"议员阁下，请原谅我话语的直接。我对议会既无意评判，也产生不了影响，但我能想象这其中会有多大阻力。","id":66,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2162_1#1$1","id":67},{"type":"dialogue","name":"某位议员","text":"那么，或许我们就应该答应他的要求，暂缓抛下封锁区地块的决议，然后他就会如约释放学生们。","id":68,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_2162_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"某位议员","text":"你相信他会兑现承诺吗？","id":69,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_2162_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_197_poca_1#3$1","id":70},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"......不，我无法信任巴普洛维奇大人。","id":71,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_197_poca_1#4$1","id":72},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"而且我也明白，您之所以会这么问我，是因为您同样无法信任他。","id":73,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2162_1#2$1","id":74},{"type":"dialogue","name":"某位议员","text":"哈哈，你很聪明，也许你和我的女儿会聊得来。","id":75,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_avg_npc_2162_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2162_1#1$1","id":76},{"type":"dialogue","name":"某位议员","text":"我的下属也向我报告过，你从封锁区回来后并没有按照他的要求，煽动家长们一同想办法保留封锁区。","id":77,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_2162_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"某位议员","text":"反之，你选择从家长们的身份、状况和性格入手，找到了我。","id":78,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_2162_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"某位议员","text":"你认为我是能左右事情的关键，也是你目前能接触到的、最有政治影响力的对象。","id":79,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_2162_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_197_poca_1#4$1","id":80},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"您的判断全都正确，我的想法，那些青涩的算计，在您面前一览无余。","id":81,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"可是阁下，我只是无法不去想我的朋友们。就在我们交谈的时候，她们正在封锁区里遭受磨难，每一秒都有丧命的风险。","id":82,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"我知道您的顾虑，是源于我想法的不现实。","id":83,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"所以阁下，我并不奢望能立即处罚巴普洛维奇大人，但至少我们应该争取改善封锁区内学生们的待遇，并解除封锁区的重型武装。","id":84,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2162_1#3$1","id":85},{"type":"dialogue","name":"某位议员","text":"......很遗憾，当下的议会大概无法满足这些请求。","id":86,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/35/Avg_avg_npc_2162_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_197_poca_1#4$1","id":87},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"巴普洛维奇大人曾和我提到，他得到了议会当中许多贵族朋友的支持。","id":88,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2162_1#1$1","id":89},{"type":"dialogue","name":"某位议员","text":"你恐怕说漏了一个“旧”字。或者说，“军事贵族”。","id":90,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_2162_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"某位议员","text":"开诚布公地说，乌萨斯贵族间的阵营对立，恐怕对玻利瓦尔人都谈不上是什么秘密了，你不必如此谨慎。","id":91,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_2162_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"某位议员","text":"由于近来的动乱，每一个决议，每一条规章，谁今天在议会上逞了口舌之快，谁明日被皇帝陛下夸奖，处处都是党同伐异，必分高低。","id":92,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_2162_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"某位议员","text":"仅是帝国议会，就有四百多名议员，他们大都家世显赫，功勋卓著。","id":93,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_2162_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"某位议员","text":"居住在圣骏堡的、姓氏被计入了《贵族谱系》的世袭贵族，有将近八百人。","id":94,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_2162_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"某位议员","text":"至于那些有影响力的荣誉市民，更是不计其数......每个人的态度都很复杂。","id":95,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_2162_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2162_1#8$1","id":96},{"type":"dialogue","name":"某位议员","text":"如果世事都像切薄饼一样能轻易分成两半......我想乌萨斯也不会走到现在这种局面。","id":97,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/33/Avg_avg_npc_2162_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_197_poca_1#5$1","id":98},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"您是想告诉我......","id":99,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"即使是新贵族，其中也有人支持巴普洛维奇大人。现在之所以无法阻止他，也是因为他有许多有权势的支持者。","id":100,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2162_1#1$1","id":101},{"type":"dialogue","name":"某位议员","text":"所以即使是我，甚至是议长，都无法在这件事情上跨过众人的意见，给你们提供任何实质性的帮助。","id":102,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_2162_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_197_poca_1#4$1","id":103},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"能有幸与您交流，就已经是莫大的帮助了。","id":104,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"我的目标不会改变，要真正解救索尼娅以及封锁区里的人们，就必须尽量干扰巴普洛维奇大人。","id":105,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2162_1#2$1","id":106},{"type":"dialogue","name":"某位议员","text":"判断不错，但只有判断是不够的。","id":107,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_avg_npc_2162_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"某位议员","text":"在年轻的时候，人们很容易知道自己应该反对什么，却很难知道自己应该去做什么。","id":108,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_avg_npc_2162_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"某位议员","text":"娜塔莉娅小姐，你会怎么做呢？","id":109,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_avg_npc_2162_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_197_poca_1#2$1","id":110},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"......如果我能调查清楚不同人支持他的原因，并且联系上一些潜在的“朋友”......","id":111,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_197_poca_1#8$1","id":112},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"您提醒过我，每一个人的态度都是复杂的。换种角度说，即使是旧贵族，即使曾经是他的盟友，也可能会在特定情况下态度发生偏移。","id":113,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2162_1#2$1","id":114},{"type":"dialogue","name":"某位议员","text":"你把那句话看作是“提醒”，这可真是......","id":115,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_avg_npc_2162_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"某位议员","text":"等事情解决之后，请一定要再来坐坐。等阿洛达没在做她自己的事的时候吧，也许......","id":116,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_avg_npc_2162_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_197_poca_1#4$1","id":117},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"您说什么？","id":118,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2162_1#1$1","id":119},{"type":"dialogue","name":"某位议员","text":"没什么。","id":120,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_2162_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"某位议员","text":"娜塔莉娅小姐，我这里有一个消息，是即使维特议长明令禁止，也已经在部分贵族中传播开来的。","id":121,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_2162_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"某位议员","text":"冬季舞会之后，出于一些原因，皇帝陛下没有返回宫殿。","id":122,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_2162_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_197_poca_1#12$1","id":123},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"......","id":124,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2162_1#1$1","id":125},{"type":"dialogue","name":"某位议员","text":"截至目前，议长暗中派人调查，却始终没有发现任何线索，排除到最后，就只剩下一个地方。","id":126,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_2162_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2162_1#9$1","id":127},{"type":"dialogue","name":"某位议员","text":"一个此时难以查证的地方。","id":128,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/55/Avg_avg_npc_2162_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_197_poca_1#6$1","id":129},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"难以查证的地方？难道——","id":130,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5b/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_197_poca_1#12$1","id":131},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"您的意思是，陛下或许在封锁区里......就连议长也没法实施搜查吗？","id":132,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2162_1#9$1","id":133},{"type":"dialogue","name":"某位议员","text":"以当下的局势来看，我们希望尽可能地低调处理，以免制造出更大的混乱。","id":134,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/55/Avg_avg_npc_2162_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"某位议员","text":"而某些不知从何处得知陛下失踪消息的贵族，却似乎希望这个局面能够持续。这也与你告诉我的情况相吻合。","id":135,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/55/Avg_avg_npc_2162_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"某位议员","text":"......一些利益交换、心照不宣的态度倾斜，又或是想趁机一劳永逸地解决压在他们头顶上最大的困难。","id":136,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/55/Avg_avg_npc_2162_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"某位议员","text":"更不用说恰好在这时，那原本应该立即启用以保护陛下的特殊手段，也出于某些原因而反应迟滞。","id":137,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/55/Avg_avg_npc_2162_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"某位议员","text":"所以，这个消息并不具有明确的时效性，甚至也不算难以打听。","id":138,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/55/Avg_avg_npc_2162_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"某位议员","text":"重要的是，在特殊手段生效之前，你可以继续按照你的方式去解决你朋友面临的问题。而如果特殊手段生效......","id":139,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/55/Avg_avg_npc_2162_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2162_1#8$1","id":140},{"type":"dialogue","name":"某位议员","text":"你的朋友们，大概就只能自求多福了。","id":141,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/33/Avg_avg_npc_2162_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_197_poca_1#8$1","id":142},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"......这个特殊手段，是指——","id":143,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2162_1#9$1","id":144},{"type":"dialogue","name":"某位议员","text":"你只需要知道，当它生效，陛下一定会安全地回到他的宫殿之中。","id":145,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/55/Avg_avg_npc_2162_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_197_poca_1#12$1","id":146},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"......","id":147,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2162_1#1$1","id":148},{"type":"dialogue","name":"某位议员","text":"不过，我这里还有一件或许能宽慰你的事。维特议长已经按下了抛下封锁区的决议，这至少在一周之内都不会改变。","id":149,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_2162_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_197_poca_1#4$1","id":150},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"......您所说的这些，对我们至关重要。我代表我自己，以及我的朋友，一同衷心地感谢您。","id":151,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":152},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":153},{"type":"charslot","id":154},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":155},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/93/Avg_bg_66_g12_deitygrypherburgmeeting.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":156},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":157},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2168_1#1$1","id":158},{"type":"dialogue","name":"仲裁人","text":"......也就是说，有议员向娜塔莉娅小姐透露，某些新贵族希望陛下在封锁区里受到折磨，甚至遇害？","id":159,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d0/Avg_avg_npc_2168_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"仲裁人","text":"尽管听证会出于维护贵族尊严的考量，赞成隐去名字的做法，但请诸位放心，此后会对此进行详尽的调查。","id":160,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d0/Avg_avg_npc_2168_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_177","id":161},{"type":"dialogue","name":"急切的贵族","text":"不，是谁？是谁已经丧心病狂到这个地步，我要求证人马上、立即公布那些禽兽的名字！","id":162,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_npc_177.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"急切的贵族","text":"把他们从巢穴里挖出来，看看他们只为金钱跳动的心脏究竟长没长着乌萨斯人的血肉！","id":163,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_npc_177.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_405_absin_1#1$2","id":164},{"type":"dialogue","name":"苦艾","text":"抱歉，我并非娜塔莉娅本人，我对信函里提到的那些人的名字一无所知。","id":165,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_avg_405_absin_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"苦艾","text":"不过从后文来看，她接下来寻访了不少历史悠久的贵族府邸，它们的主人似乎同样不太热情......当然，您也可以说他们是不为金钱所动。","id":166,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_avg_405_absin_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_177","id":167},{"type":"multiline","name":"急切的贵族","text":"这、这太荒谬了，无论是谁都说出来，不然就是——","id":168},{"type":"multiline","name":"急切的贵族","text":"拉我干什么？","id":169},{"type":"dialog","id":170},{"type":"charslot","id":171},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"20","ystrength":"20","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":172},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_slap","id":173},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":174},{"type":"text","text":"他下意识地狠狠挥手，清脆的巴掌声再次驱散了听证会上难得的凝重，在场所有人好奇地看过去，刚才阻止他的同伴正捂着脸。","id":175},{"type":"text","text":"同伴面对着众人的“关切”，只得对他们挤出一个僵硬的讪笑，但双眼却恶狠狠地瞟向急切而冒失的贵族，对方悻悻地合上了嘴巴。","id":176},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_405_absin_1#1$2","id":177},{"type":"dialogue","name":"苦艾","text":"那，我还应该继续往下说吗？毕竟在这之后，有人给了娜塔莉娅一份军事贵族的名单，附在这封信件后。","id":178,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_avg_405_absin_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_405_absin_1#7$2","id":179},{"type":"dialogue","name":"苦艾","text":"信上写着，这些贵族未经核验就咬定陛下失踪是谣言，还有人想通过娜塔莉娅趁机勒索那些孩子被抓的家长......","id":180,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f7/Avg_avg_405_absin_1-7$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"苦艾","text":"尤其是在十二月二十九日下午，有一位不愿透露姓名的绅士向娜塔莉娅勒索——","id":181,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f7/Avg_avg_405_absin_1-7$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2168_1#1$1","id":182},{"type":"dialogue","name":"仲裁人","text":"等等，你不能透露那些贵族的具体信息。","id":183,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d0/Avg_avg_npc_2168_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_405_absin_1#1$2","id":184},{"type":"dialogue","name":"苦艾","text":"我会按照要求隐去他们的名字，也不会对他们的行为进行评判。","id":185,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_avg_405_absin_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2168_1#1$1","id":186},{"type":"dialogue","name":"仲裁人","text":"......具体时间和地点特征也要规避，不要对我的实质要求故作不知。只说事情，只说事情本身，明白了吗？！","id":187,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d0/Avg_avg_npc_2168_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_405_absin_1#1$2","id":188},{"type":"dialogue","name":"苦艾","text":"没有问题，阁下。","id":189,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_avg_405_absin_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"苦艾","text":"在此之后，虽然娜塔莉娅确实赢得了一部分家长的支持，但最关键的是，她在某日登门拜访了一位重要的贵族人士。","id":190,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_avg_405_absin_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_405_absin_1#9$2","id":191},{"type":"dialogue","name":"苦艾","text":"他长期支持巴普洛维奇大人，并始终宣扬应对犯事学生实施重刑，只要——","id":192,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_405_absin_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":193},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":194},{"type":"charslot","id":195},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":196},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/31/Avg_bg_33_g7_reception.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":197},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":198},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":199},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2165_1#4$1","duration":"1.5","id":200},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":201},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"......您认同我们的想法，就能最大限度地降低封锁区内的交火烈度。","id":202,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fd/Avg_avg_npc_2165_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":203},{"type":"dialogue","name":"某位公爵","text":"罗斯托夫家的小姐......请回吧，若不是你放言事态危急，我本没有和切尔诺伯格的贵族打交道的想法。","id":204},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2165_1#9$1","id":205},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"公爵阁下，此事关乎陛下安危，谁都承担不起让乌萨斯面临国难的罪责。","id":206,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e6/Avg_avg_npc_2165_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":207},{"type":"dialogue","name":"某位公爵","text":"国难？孩子，你或许不知道，这些年的圣骏堡，每天都有疯子高喊这个词——当然，我并不是在说你。","id":208},{"type":"dialogue","name":"某位公爵","text":"对于你口中那骇人听闻的消息，请原谅我不得不故作不知。毕竟我的理智在不断向我提醒——这又是那些暴发户自导自演的戏码。","id":209},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2165_1#3$1","id":210},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"或许是我理解错了，但您似乎是在指责我们拿陛下的安危演戏，完全不担心危险发生的后果。","id":211,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_avg_npc_2165_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":212},{"type":"dialogue","name":"某位公爵","text":"不，我只是不接受讹诈，即使你穿戴得齐整高贵，就像任何一个圣骏堡的贵族那样。","id":213},{"type":"dialogue","name":"某位公爵","text":"在如今的乌萨斯，没有什么比教育那些思想中毒的年轻人更为重要。","id":214},{"type":"dialogue","name":"某位公爵","text":"如果说，在皇村——在萨列夫格勒区聚众闹事都不能严惩，乌萨斯还有什么威信可言？","id":215},{"type":"dialogue","name":"某位公爵","text":"你关心同学的心情可以理解，我不会追究你为暴民辩护的罪责，今天的会面，就当没有发生过吧。","id":216},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2165_1#4$1","id":217},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"......我明白了，公爵阁下。","id":218,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fd/Avg_avg_npc_2165_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"不过，请相信，您终有一天，也会起身为所谓的“暴民”辩护。","id":219,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fd/Avg_avg_npc_2165_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":220},{"type":"dialogue","name":"某位公爵","text":"......你说什么？","id":221},{"type":"dialog","id":222},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_armycrowd","volume":"0.5","id":223},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":224},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2165_1#12$1","id":225},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"我会找到您，是因为我从一些贵族那里听闻，您和您的继承人一直在私底下煽动学生。","id":226,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ed/Avg_avg_npc_2165_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2165_1#3$1","id":227},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"有人已经掌握了相关证据，能够证明公爵阁下府邸中的地下室，就是学生活动的据点，甚至拍摄到了他们就在您花园里排演的画面。","id":228,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_avg_npc_2165_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":229},{"type":"dialogue","name":"某位公爵","text":"......呵，无谓的尝试。孩子，无论你再怎么虚张声势，我也不会上当。","id":230},{"type":"charslot","id":231},{"type":"text","text":"他缓缓起身，不再对上娜塔莉娅的目光。","id":232},{"type":"dialogue","name":"某位公爵","text":"我已经警告过你，如果试图讹诈——","id":233},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":234},{"type":"dialog","id":235},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":236},{"type":"charslot","id":237},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":238},{"type":"background","id":239},{"type":"cgitem","duration":"1","id":240,"from":"0.5","to":"0.5"},{"type":"cg","duration":"5","from":"1","to":"0","id":241},{"type":"cgitem","image":"cgitem_72_i06_3","style":"cg","pfrom":"80,0","pto":"100,0","pduration":"20","afrom":"0","ato":"1","aduration":"0","layer":"2","sfrom":"1","sto":"1","id":242},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b8/Avg_72_i06_2.png","screenadapt":"coverall","xScale":"1.2","yScale":"1.2","y":"30","id":243},{"type":"imagetween","duration":"20","block":"false","xFrom":"50","xTo":"30","id":244},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_sunlight_r","layer":"1","y":"200","xto":"200","yto":"200","movetime":"30","id":245},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_sunlight_l","layer":"2","y":"200","x":"250","xto":"300","yto":"200","movetime":"30","id":246},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_armycrowd","id":247},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":248},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_ursusdaily_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":249,"musicid":2},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":250},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"听我的口令！队尾转队首，齐步撤退！","id":251},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"据我所知，很早就有人猜测您的继承人与学生组织之间的关系，而您甚至为此威胁过她的老师们，要求禁止这类“谣言”传播。","id":252},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"可凑巧的是，自从冬季舞会那时参与示威的学生们被捕后，您的继承人就再也没有露面。","id":253},{"type":"dialogue","name":"某位公爵","text":"那是因为她正在中部研学——","id":254},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"您当然可以继续自欺欺人。只是，也许是我自作多情，想当然地认为自己与您有相似的立场，能够帮您挽回继承人的前程......","id":255},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"唉，可怜的奥尔佳。","id":256},{"type":"dialogue","name":"某位公爵","text":"你、你做了什么？！","id":257},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"我就在这里，什么也没做。也许只是恰巧在您家里遇上了他们排练的时刻。","id":258},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"或者说，连我这样的不速之客，都能无意间撞见他们的举动，恰恰说明这些学生在您府中的活跃程度，不是吗？","id":259},{"type":"dialogue","name":"某位公爵","text":"你——","id":260},{"type":"dialog","id":261},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":262},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_sunlight_r","layer":"1","y":"300","x":"300","id":263},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_sunlight_l","layer":"2","y":"300","x":"300","id":264},{"type":"cgitem","image":"cgitem_72_i06_3","style":"cg","layer":"2","sfrom":"1","sto":"0.85","sduration":"30","pfrom":"100,10","pto":"90,0","pduration":"30","id":265},{"type":"cgitem","duration":"10","id":266,"from":"0.5","to":"0"},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleFrom":"1.2","yScaleFrom":"1.2","xScaleTo":"1","yScaleTo":"1","yTo":"0","xTo":"0","duration":"30","id":267},{"type":"cg","duration":"30","from":"0","to":"0.5","id":268},{"type":"cgitem","image":"cgitem_72_i06_1","style":"cg","layer":"1","sfrom":"0.85","sto":"1","sduration":"30","pfrom":"-530,100","pto":"-430,0","pduration":"30","id":269},{"type":"cgitem","image":"cgitem_72_i06_2","style":"cg","layer":"3","sfrom":"0.85","sto":"1","sduration":"30","pfrom":"570,100","pto":"470,0","pduration":"30","id":270},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":271},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":272},{"type":"text","text":"窗外阳光炫目，早露垂下眼睛，以无法让人察觉的幅度点了点头，旋即换上了属于贵族小姐的礼貌笑容。","id":273},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"如我所说，我只是听到了一些传闻。对公爵阁下而言，幸运的是，它们并没有扩散。","id":274},{"type":"dialogue","name":"某位公爵","text":"......你想要什么？","id":275},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"不是我想要什么，是您需要守护自己，和整个家族的未来。","id":276},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"现在刚过正午，希望您能允许我在此稍作休息，静候您的答复——","id":277},{"type":"dialog","id":278},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":279},{"type":"charslot","id":280},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":281},{"type":"image","id":282},{"type":"hidecgitem","id":283},{"type":"bgeffect","id":284},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/93/Avg_bg_66_g12_deitygrypherburgmeeting.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":285},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":286},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"20","ystrength":"20","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":287},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"不，不是这样的！","id":288},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"这是谎言......仲裁人阁下！","id":289},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2168_1#1$1","id":290},{"type":"dialogue","name":"仲裁人","text":"特里波列夫公爵？","id":291,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d0/Avg_avg_npc_2168_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":292},{"type":"charslot","id":293},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2171_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":294},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":295},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特里波列夫公爵","text":"我坦白，娜塔莉娅·罗斯托娃找到的人是我，我也的确同意了削减巴普洛维奇军备的要求。","id":296,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/91/Avg_avg_npc_2171_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特里波列夫公爵","text":"但我的女儿是无罪的！她是被他们、被这群学生组织的疯子胁迫的！","id":297,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/91/Avg_avg_npc_2171_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特里波列夫公爵","text":"她会在今天出席作证，勇敢地证明自己的清白，揭露娜塔莉娅的谎言。她就是下一个证人。","id":298,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/91/Avg_avg_npc_2171_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_405_absin_1#6$2","id":299},{"type":"dialogue","name":"苦艾","text":"公爵大人，娜塔莉娅的这封信，忏悔的便是对您、对其他人的不诚实。","id":300,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a8/Avg_avg_405_absin_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"苦艾","text":"乌萨斯从来没有给过我们机会，而从始至终，娜塔莉娅也没有背叛任何人，她只是做出了正确的选择，保护了应当保护的朋友。","id":301,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a8/Avg_avg_405_absin_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"苦艾","text":"无论谁出面，在这里发表任何搬弄是非的证词，她都无愧于乌萨斯，无愧于我们。","id":302,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a8/Avg_avg_405_absin_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2171_1#1$1","id":303},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特里波列夫公爵","text":"你——","id":304,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/91/Avg_avg_npc_2171_1$1.png"},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"20","ystrength":"20","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":305},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2168_1#1$1","id":306},{"type":"playsound","key":"$gavel1","id":307},{"type":"dialogue","name":"仲裁人","text":"肃静！","id":308,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d0/Avg_avg_npc_2168_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"仲裁人","text":"临时休会十分钟。","id":309,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d0/Avg_avg_npc_2168_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"仲裁人","text":"书记官，让下一位证人做好准备......","id":310,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d0/Avg_avg_npc_2168_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":311},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.5","id":312},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_peoplestandup","id":313},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":314},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_177","id":315},{"type":"dialogue","name":"急切的贵族","text":"沃伦佐娃夫人......我不明白，这不像您的作风。","id":316,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_npc_177.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"急切的贵族","text":"您明明拿到了娜塔莉娅真正的证词，如果能够与卓娅的说法对峙，至少不会让列位贵族如此失态。","id":317,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_npc_177.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"急切的贵族","text":"可您从她讲述封锁区的遭遇开始就沉默不语，有好几位大人都在看着您，愤怒溢于言表。","id":318,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_npc_177.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"急切的贵族","text":"您到底在等什么？","id":319,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_npc_177.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2173_1#1$1","id":320},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃伦佐娃夫人","text":"......","id":321,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_2173_1$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":322},{"type":"dialog","id":323},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":324},{"type":"charslot","id":325},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":326},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_197_poca_1#4$1","id":327},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/47/Avg_bg_72_g13_nobleroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":328},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":329},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act28side/m_avg_wasteland_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":330,"musicid":3},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"......如您所愿。","id":331,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2173_1#1$1","id":332},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃伦佐娃夫人","text":"好，好。这样，我就还来得及对你的父母有所交代。一切都还来得及。","id":333,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_2173_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃伦佐娃夫人","text":"瞧瞧，真是漂亮的字迹啊，娜塔申卡。让我看看你有没有遗漏——","id":334,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_2173_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃伦佐娃夫人","text":"......","id":335,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_2173_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃伦佐娃夫人","text":"......娜塔申卡，你......","id":336,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_2173_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃伦佐娃夫人","text":"你写的这些，都是什么呀？这不是“忏悔信”吗？","id":337,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_2173_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_197_poca_1#4$1","id":338},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"是的，忏悔信。","id":339,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_197_poca_1#15$1","id":340},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"我忏悔，向所有曾受我的诡计蒙骗的人，和所有被这些人利用并抛弃的、受难的学生。","id":341,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9d/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-15$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_197_poca_1#5$1","id":342},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"他们都曾是我的同学，即使我们从未就读于同一所学校。","id":343,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"我们也都是乌萨斯人，我们本该拥有同样的命运。","id":344,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2173_1#1$1","id":345},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃伦佐娃夫人","text":"不，不！","id":346,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_2173_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃伦佐娃夫人","text":"孩子，我的孩子！是谁要让你背负这样的痛苦？是谁指责你将他们欺骗？这不是我想让你做的，这绝不是！","id":347,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_2173_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃伦佐娃夫人","text":"天哪，玛尔莎，我......我该怎么办？我该怎么做才能宽慰你可怜的孩子？不要说这样恐怖的话了，娜塔申卡，这不是你的错！","id":348,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_2173_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_197_poca_1#12$1","id":349},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"可总有人应该为此付出代价，或背负罪责，夫人。","id":350,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"我写下这些，按照您的要求描述这些人的参与，以及......我所知道的故事。您却说，这不是我应该做的。","id":351,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"难道我剖开自己的做法不对吗？还是说我应该永远对责任敬而远之，就像个永远长不大的孩子？","id":352,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2173_1#1$1","id":353},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃伦佐娃夫人","text":"在我们面前，你们永远都只是孩子！我也只是想帮助你，像帮助任何一个朋友的亲人——甚至像帮助自己的孩子。","id":354,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_2173_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃伦佐娃夫人","text":"不过是些荒唐的、尽可以被原谅的错误，谁需要这样沉重的忏悔？我决不愿看你自苦至此，我的......娜塔申卡......","id":355,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_2173_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_197_poca_1#4$1","id":356},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"我明白，夫人，我都明白。","id":357,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"您的热情，您的真挚，甚至常常达到使我在相处中觉得煎熬的程度。可这并不是您的问题。","id":358,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_197_poca_1#3$1","id":359},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"只是我自己，在这些日子接触到太多以往遥不可及的高贵之人后，在亲身了解了他们的所思所想和对乌萨斯的感情后，总忍不住去想——","id":360,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_197_poca_1#5$1","id":361},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"骏鹰王国尚未灭亡的时候，如今的乌萨斯贵族们的祖先，也都是一个个普通人，就连伊戈尔大帝也只是军旅行伍中的一员。","id":362,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_197_poca_1#12$1","id":363},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"在骏鹰挥动着鞭子的时候，他们毫无畏惧地冲了上去，挡在被奴役者的身前。这才让大家相信，他们拥有荣耀的、勇者的血脉。","id":364,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"但若是有一天，这些流淌着勇者血液的人，选择将另一些被压迫和被侮辱的人踩在脚下，甚至拿起了骏鹰曾挥动的鞭子......","id":365,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_197_poca_1#15$1","id":366},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"还会有人相信他们，甘愿与他们为伍吗？","id":367,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9d/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-15$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_197_poca_1#9$1","id":368},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"而我，竟然也要加入，作为其中的一员吗？","id":369,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2173_1#1$1","id":370},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃伦佐娃夫人","text":"这是......我们与生俱来的权利——","id":371,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_2173_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃伦佐娃夫人","text":"娜塔申卡，不......","id":372,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_2173_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_197_poca_1#4$1","id":373},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"不，夫人，只有这一次，请容我拒绝。","id":374,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"如果说，有什么权利是我希望所有人都能与生俱来的，那一定是......","id":375,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_197_poca_1#5$1","id":376},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"“选择权”。","id":377,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2173_1#1$1","id":378},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃伦佐娃夫人","text":"......","id":379,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_2173_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_197_poca_1#4$1","id":380},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"而现在，正如您所说......“一切都还来得及”。","id":381,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"来得及让我做出选择，来得及让我决定背负。","id":382,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":383},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":384},{"type":"charslot","id":385},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":386},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2173_1#1$1","id":387},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/93/Avg_bg_66_g12_deitygrypherburgmeeting.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":388},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":389},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃伦佐娃夫人","text":"......只是，没有必要。","id":390,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_2173_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃伦佐娃夫人","text":"“再怎么精心编造的谎言，也敌不过切身经历的事实”。娜塔申卡......只是做出了选择。","id":391,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_2173_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_177","id":392},{"type":"dialogue","name":"急切的贵族","text":"可她蒙骗了您，至少要让她付出代价——","id":393,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_npc_177.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2173_1#1$1","id":394},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃伦佐娃夫人","text":"大人，我感谢您的热心，只不过......","id":395,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_2173_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃伦佐娃夫人","text":"我已经有些累了。","id":396,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_2173_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":397},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":398},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":399},{"type":"bgeffect","id":400},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":401},{"type":"hidecgitem","id":402},{"type":"image","id":403},{"type":"charslot","text":"","id":404}],"characters":["苦艾","急切的贵族","仲裁人","早露","某位议员","某位公爵","？？？","特里波列夫公爵","沃伦佐娃夫人"]}